Package: kbd-autolight
Version: @VERSION@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: @MAINTAINER@
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Depends: python3 (>= 3.9), python3-gi, gir1.2-glib-2.0, upower, systemd
Recommends: plasma-workspace (>= 4:6.0)
Homepage: @HOMEPAGE@
Description: automatic keyboard backlight for the Lenovo Yoga Slim 7 ProX 14ARH7
 Turns the keyboard backlight up in the dark and off in bright light,
 using the laptop's ambient light sensor. It runs as a systemd user
 service, talks to the keyboard through UPower (no root needed) and
 pauses itself when you change the brightness by hand.
 .
 Includes a KDE Plasma system tray applet with an on/off switch.
 .
 Made and tested for the Yoga Slim 7 ProX 14ARH7 (type 82TL).
